hadiths[88]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1552","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from his father that in a letter which the Messenger of Allah"
"1553","Malik related to me that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab estimated the full blood-money for the people of urban areas. For those who had gold"
"1554","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1555","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Marwan ibn al-Hakam wrote to Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan that a madman was brought to him who had killed a man. Muawiya wrote to him"
"1556","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Irak ibn Malik and Sulayman ibn Yasar that a man of the Banu Sad ibn Layth was running a horse and it trod on the finger of a man from the Juhayna tribe. It bled profusely"
"1557","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab"
"1558","Malik related to me that the generally agreed on way of doing things amongst the community about an accident is that there is no blood-money until the victim is better. If a man's bone"
"1559","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab and also Urwa ibn az-Zubayr said the same as Said ibn al-Musayyab said about a woman. Her blood-money from a man is the same up to a third of the blood-money of a man. If what she is owed exceeds a third of the blood-money of the man"
"1560","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1561","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf from Abu Hurayra that a woman from the Hudhayl tribe threw a stone at a woman from the same tribe"
"1562","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1563","Yahya related to me from Malik that Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman said"
"1564","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said ibn al- Musayyab used to say"
"1565","Yahya related to me from Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab about the one-eyed man who gouged out the eye of a healthy person. Ibn Shihab said"
"1566","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Zayd ibn Thabit used to say"
"1567","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Sulayman ibn Yasar mention that a face wound in which the bone was bared was like a head wound in which the bone was bared"
"1568","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said"
"1569","Malik related to me"
"1570","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr allowed retaliation for a head wound which splintered the bone"
"1571","ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman said"
"1572","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Muslim ibn Jundub from Aslam"
"1573","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1574","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
"1575","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Abu Ghatafan ibn Tarif al-Murri informed him that Marwan ibn al-Hakam sent him to Abdullah ibn Abbas to ask him what there was for the molar. Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"1576","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father made all the teeth the same in the blood-money and did not prefer any kind over others. Malik said"
"1577","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1578","Malik related to me that he had heard that Marwan ibn al-Hakam gave a decision about a slave who was injured that the person who injured him had to pay what he had diminished of the value of the slave. Malik said"
"1579","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz gave a decision that when a jew or christian was killed"
"1580","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1581","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"1582","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1584","Malik said that Ibn Shihab said"
"1585","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Umar ibn al- Khattab demanded of the people at Mina"
"1586","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Amr ibn Shuayb that a man of the Banu Mudlij called Qatada threw a sword at his son and it struck his thigh. The wound bled profusely and he died. Suraqa ibn Jusham came to Umar ibn al-Khattab and mentioned that to him Umar said to him"
"1587","Malik said that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar were asked"
"1588","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that a man of the Ansar called Uhayha ibn al-Julah had a young paternal uncle who was younger than him and who was living with his maternal uncles. Uhayha took him and killed him. His maternal uncles said"
"1589","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab and Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1590","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab killed five or seven people for one man whom they had killed secretly by trickery. Umar said"
"1591","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Sad ibn Zurara that he had heard that Hafsa"
"1592","Yahya related to me from Malik from Umar ibn Husayn"
"1593","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Marwan ibn al-Hakam wrote to Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan to mention to him that a drunkard was brought to him who had killed a man. Muawiya wrote to him to kill him in retaliation for the dead man. Yahya said that Malik said"
"1594","Yahya related to me from Malik that he saw whomever he was satisfied with among the people of knowledge say about a man who willed that his murderer be pardoned when he murdered him intentionally"
"1595","Yahya said that Malik said"
"1672","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1673","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi from his father that Abu Hurayra said"
"1674","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyub said"
"1675","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr from Jabir ibn Abdullah as-Salami that the Messenger of Allah"
"1676","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Bakr ibn Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1677","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1678","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ibn Bujayd (formerly al-Ansari) from his grandmother that the Messenger of Allah"
"1679","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj that Abu Hurayra said"
"1680","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1681","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Zayd ibn Abdullah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab from Abdullah ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abi Bakras-Siddiq from Umm Salama"
"1682","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ayyub ibn Habib"
"1683","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab and Ali ibn Abi Talib and Uthman ibn Affan drank while standing"
"1684","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that A'isha"
"1685","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu Jafar al-Qari said"
"1686","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amir ibn Abdullah ibn az- Zubayr that his father used to drink while standing"
"1687","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"
"1688","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar from Sahl ibn Sad al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"1689","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha heard Anas ibn Malik say that Abu Talha had said to Umm Sulaym"
"1690","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1691","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki from Jabir ibn Abdullah that the Messenger of Allah"
"1692","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi from Abu Shurayh al-Kabi that the Messenger of Allah"
"1693","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sumayy"
"1694","Yahya related to me from Malik from Wahb ibn Kaysan that Jabir ibn Abdullah said"
"1695","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Amr ibn Sad ibn Muadh from his grandmother that the Messenger of Allah"
"1696","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr said"
"1697","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Isa ibn Maryam used to say"
"1698","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1699","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Umar ibn al-Khattab was eating bread with ghee. He summoned one of the desert people and he began to eat and follow the grease in the dish with a morsel of bread. Umar said"
"1700","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1701","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1702","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Halhala that Humayd ibn Malik ibn Khu'haym said"
"1703","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Nuaym that Wahb ibn Kaysan said"
"1704","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he had heard al-Qasim ibn Muhammad say that a man came to Abdullah ibn Abbas and said to him"
"1705","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father never brought food or drink"
"1706","Yahya said that Malik was asked"
"1707","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1708","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1709","Yahya related to me from Malik that Sadaqa ibn Yasar said"
"1710","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from Abbad ibn Tamim that Abu Bashir al-Ansari told him that he was with the Messenger of Allah"
"1711","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abi Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf heard his father say"
"1712","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab that Abu Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf said"
"1713","Yahya related to me from Malik that Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki said"
"1714","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Urwa ibn az-Zubayr told him that the Messenger of Allah"
"1715","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1716","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Khusayfa that Urwa ibn az-Zubayr said that he heard A'isha"